{"id":"8f5ab08dd390d871","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-rdcomponent.md","title":"The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation","display":"thm-rdcomponent — The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-rdcomponent","aliases":["27-thm-rdcomponent"],"display":"thm-rdcomponent — The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation","depends_on":["[[27-df-rdpartition]]","[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§6.6 Theorem 6.15","source_statement":"The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation","source_printed_pages":"294","source_pdf_pages":"318","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-rdcomponent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-rdcomponent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rdcomponent — The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9b156726c5da6a79\" href=\"?note=9b156726c5da6a79\" title=\"27-df-rdpartition\">27-df-rdpartition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.6 Theorem 6.15"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f5ab08dd390d871\" href=\"?note=8f5ab08dd390d871\" title=\"The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation\">The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"294"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"318"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(h\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))\">\\(U=\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9b156726c5da6a79\" href=\"?note=9b156726c5da6a79\" title=\"27-df-rdpartition\">27-df-rdpartition</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\subseteq U\">\\(\\eta\\subseteq U\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta\\cap R)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\mathrm{PI}(h)\\cap R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta\\cap R)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\mathrm{PI}(h)\\cap R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从 η 用 consensus 生成全部素项，再闭包正好得到 U。要得到 R 中的项，其两个父项必须都在 R，因此仅 η∩R 已生成 R。对完整素项表示同理，两者的素项相同。η⊆QCl(PI(h)) 是实质前提，任意不可约 DNF 不能替代它。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-rdpartition","status":"resolved","id":"9b156726c5da6a79","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-rdpartition]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation","status":"resolved","id":"8f5ab08dd390d871","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$，$U=\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))$，$\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)$；见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-rdpartition]]。$\\eta\\subseteq U$ 且 $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$，$U=\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))$，$\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)$；见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-rdpartition]]。$\\eta\\subseteq U$ 且 $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-rdpartition","status":"resolved","id":"9b156726c5da6a79","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$，$U=\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))$，$\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)$；见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-rdpartition]]。$\\eta\\subseteq U$ 且 $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta\\cap R)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\mathrm{PI}(h)\\cap R).","display":true}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-rdcomponent|thm-rdcomponent — The recessive component is independent of the Horn representation]]"}],"outgoing":["9b156726c5da6a79","bb96ce122f7cd0ef","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}